At first, I was really bad at dancing, so whenever I had a live or had to dance in front of everyone, I felt so much nervousness and anxiety.

137
00:10:25,783 --> 00:10:27,663
ま、今回は、
But this time,

138
00:10:28,073 --> 00:10:33,563
